+ Tap Build number seven times in About phone
- Long-press the power button
- Install Android Studio on the phone
- Enable airplane mode
> Tapping Build number repeatedly enables Developer options.
? fill: To run the app in Chrome, use `flutter run -d ___`.
= chrome
> -d selects the target device.
? tf: Debug builds accurately reflect release performance.
= false
> Debug mode includes extra checks and JIT; use profile/release for performance.
